# The built _site is committed as TEXT (HTML, .tex, assets) PLUS the .sha512
# checksum sidecars. The binaries themselves (PDF, docx) are NEVER committed --
# they are rebuilt at deploy inside the pinned toolchain image and verified
# against the committed .sha512 (bit-for-bit). Keeping binaries out of git avoids
# repo bloat and GitHub abuse flags.
_site/**/*.pdf
_site/**/*.docx
__pycache__/
*.pyc
